<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p><strong><%= @unlocked_by %></strong> unlocked allocation runs for <strong><%= @fund.name %></strong>.
These locked financial statements are now back to <strong>Draft</strong>:</p>

<ul>
  <% @period_dates.each do |from, to| %>
    <li><%= l(from) %> – <%= l(to) %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>What was published is kept as the frozen copy until the statements are locked again. Once the
allocations are re-run, regenerate the statements, review the checks and lock them again.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Open Financial Statements", financial_statements_url(fund_id: @fund.id, host: @entity.sub_domain + '.' + ENV.fetch('DOMAIN', 'localhost')), class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %></p>

<p>Thank you,<br><%= @entity.name %> System</p>
